; KrishMix EA5 - Multi-Asset Portfolio  |  attach ONCE, on any chart
;
; Covers the whole watchlist from a single chart. Three jobs:
;   1. entries on every asset independently - one asset never blocks another
;   2. cross-asset assist: when one symbol is stuck, the others help pull it
;      out, with the load split across every helper that has conviction
;   3. portfolio exit once everything together is far enough ahead
;
; Check InpSymbols against Market Watch first. Names vary by broker
; (XAUUSD vs XAUUSD.a, USTEC vs NAS100 vs US100) - the EA resolves suffixes
; automatically and logs whatever it could not find.
;
; InpAssistHorizonAtr is in ATR MULTIPLES, not price. Contract values span
; four orders of magnitude across this watchlist ($100 per dollar of gold per
; lot, $1 per index point per lot), so only an ATR-normalised horizon gives
; sane lots on every asset.
;
; InpAssistMaxOvershoot exists because broker minimum volume on the indices is
; 0.10 lots, which over 8 ATR on the Dow is worth about $120. A $50 drawdown
; therefore cannot be assisted there without the help becoming a bigger bet
; than the problem, so such a helper is SKIPPED and the reason logged.
;
; KEEP InpMagicBase IDENTICAL IN EVERY KrishMix EA.
InpMagicBase=51000
InpCommissionPerLot=0
InpSlippagePoints=40
InpSymbols=XAUUSD,BTCUSD,XAGUSD,XTIUSD,USTEC,US30
InpDeferToSuite=true
InpAllowEntries=true
InpLot=0.01
InpScaleLotByAsset=true
InpRiskPerEntry=20
InpMaxEntriesPerSym=1
InpMinScore=40
InpMinAdx=20
InpRequireMtfAgree=true
InpFreshTrendOnly=true
InpFreshMinRetrace=50
InpEntryTpAtrMult=2
InpEntryCooldownSec=600
InpMaxSpreadAtr=0.3
InpAllowAssist=true
InpAssistTriggerDd=60
InpAssistCoverage=1
InpAssistHorizonAtr=8
InpAssistMinScore=55
InpAssistMinAdx=24
InpAssistRequireTrend=true
InpAssistBlockExhaust=true
InpAssistMaxOvershoot=2
InpAssistMaxLotPerSym=1
InpAssistMaxLegsPerSym=2
InpAssistCooldownSec=300
InpClosePortfolio=true
InpPfTargetPerLot=25
InpPfMinTarget=2
InpPfManageFromLegs=2
InpPfDepthReliefFrom=4
InpPfDepthReliefStep=0.94
InpPfMinReliefFloor=0.2
InpEmaFast=8
InpEmaSlow=21
InpEmaFilter=50
InpWorkTf=15
InpMtf1=16385
InpMtf2=16388
InpAdxPeriod=14
InpAtrPeriod=14
InpDonchianPeriod=40
InpShowPanel=true
InpLogSeconds=300
